    <string name="accessibility_description">Reads the signed-in account name from Tailscale\'s own screen so the widget can display it. Only Tailscale\'s window is observed; nothing leaves this device.</string>

    <string name="setup_title">Account on the widget</string>
    <string name="setup_body">Tailscale does not share the active account with other apps. To show it on the widget, this app reads the login name from Tailscale\'s account screen.\n\nIt observes only Tailscale\'s window, stores the name on this device, and has no internet permission.</string>
